id=pico4_power_tuner
name=PICO 4 Power Mode Tuner
version=v1.2
versionCode=3
author=wzy
description=Companion for pico4-power-mode (LSPosed). Applies CPU/GPU performance scheduling when Performance Mode is active (follows the module's eyebuffer signal: 2448=on, else stock). Uses root for governor writes; no prompts. Install alongside the pico4-power-mode APK.
